title: ZeroPoint Node
abstract: >-
  Vortex sequence and its reflection through the void, with a computed kernel
  that proves both — fold / digital-root spine, A432 algebra adapters, and
  content-addressed integrity receipts.

  LICENSING, in short. This repository is split. Five files are free core under
