  src/0/3/6/9/1/2/4/8/7/5/1/: a432.algebra.ts, a432.algebra.js, a432.roots.ts).
  EVERY other file is proprietary and needs a separate licence from ZeroPoint —
  including the rest of src/, the kernel, integrity, MCP, demos, HTML surfaces,
  docs projections, scripts, and packaged builds. Contact license@zeropoint.bg.

  Citing this work is not permission to use it. AGPL-3.0-or-later also carries
